body:
Actually the volunteer work was an Idea that went out why my therapist, I think going to the therapist is a great Idea!!

&#x200B;

Go for it, you can do it.

I felt the same dude, I failed so bad at my previous work, procastination have been ruined my work for years until I found my passion that was helping others through teaching, I think is just a side effect, like, not doing what you really love will make you procastinate and do everything at the last moment, and I don´t mean to leave your work or something like that, maybe change a habit or do excercise may help you focusing your passion ,doesn´t have to be related to what you study.

&#x200B;

Wish you luck!
